{"overview":"در دنیای شلوغ بشر انواع مختلفی از اجنه با صلح و آرامش در کنار انسان‌ها زندگی می‌کنند. لو شیائو هی یک گربه شیطانی است که خانه او در جنگل نابود شده و حالا او حیران و سرگردان شده است. او به کمک انسان‌ها و دوستانش باید به دنبال سرپناهی برای خود باشد اما…","tagline":"","overview_en":"When cat spirit Luo Xiaohei's home is deforested by humans, he must find a new one. He runs into a group of other spirit creatures who take him under their wing with dreams of reconquering the land they say is rightfully theirs. However, they run into a human known as Wuxian who separates Luo Xiaohei from the other spirits and the two go on a journey, with the cat spirit learning to control his abilities as well as forming his own thoughts on whether or not he should ally with the spirits or the humans.","tagline_en":"One Small Spirit Will Determine the Fate of the World.","runtime":102,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["MTJJ"],"countries":["CN"],"cast":[{"name":"王宥霁","role":"Luo Xiaohei / Nezha (voice)","photo":"/3QLlwAkrcI0On0nA7tPBulGglxG.jpg"},{"name":"劉朙月","role":"Wuxian (voice)","photo":"/kqh1vBsQ35b617dvd9jtvQ2ii7l.jpg"},{"name":"郝祥海","role":"Fengxi (voice)","photo":"/mDGtY44WlZbk8pMmuzPToIommx4.jpg"},{"name":"叮当","role":"Luozhu (voice)","photo":"/vXMuscwMmOjVgv5tZMILhjguLWd.jpg"},{"name":"Yuntu Cao","role":"Xuhuai (voice)","photo":"/9qSDFftuxOJh2vKw255g0RsAV3h.jpg"},{"name":"冯盛","role":"Tianhu (voice)","photo":"/1IB7v7KhJWfTTylZHhFXHw5SVFR.jpg"},{"name":"陈思宇","role":"Jiulao (voice)","photo":"/mCUJU1qQb79BeI5Ke76PbOj34HV.jpg"}],"trailer":"NC9M8QYRZpE","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/620249/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Shout! Factory Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/ydhPmamP2uIMipgq8qIEfmcw2hT.png"},{"n":"The CW","kind":"free","logo":"/6fcYLKQIjGnrswtH7WxjjoSiyy3.png"},{"n":"Hoopla","kind":"free","logo":"/gtjNBzAoGgUtYzt0UKXmwG34WWL.png"},